You know, everybody wants tutorials.

00:34:32.700 --> 00:34:34.700
Everybody wants Skyward Sword, you know?

00:34:34.820 --> 00:34:37.160
This happened over and over and over again.

00:34:38.720 --> 00:34:48.800
And I think Zelda 2 and Majora's Mask are, like, those two games that, like, didn't quite have that flow because, you know, the games that came before them were considered the best.

00:34:49.020 --> 00:34:50.300
Yeah. You know, at the time.

00:34:50.300 --> 00:34:58.020
